  <description>
    <p>
      Nerd Dictation is a lightweight, offline speech-to-text application
      that uses the Vosk toolkit. It allows you to dictate text without
      an internet connection, focusing on simplicity and efficiency.
    </p>
    <p>Features:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Offline operation</li>
      <li>Simple command-line interface</li>
      <li>Cross-platform (Linux)</li>
      <li>Powered by Vosk</li>
    </ul>
